      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Control plane & HA state",
      "items": [
        "CoW Arc routing with canary, fallback, breakers; bounded PgWirePool (OMNI_PG_POOL_SIZE=8)",
        "LISTEN/NOTIFY channel dispatch keeps task updates out of registry reload storms",
        "SkillEngine merges curated skills with auto-synthesized Code Mode playbooks",
        "HA OAuth flows & ChaCha20-Poly1305 tokens; omni migrate --to-v6.8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Code Mode, tasks & files",
      "items": [
        "AST VM (~100 µs) with wasmi sandbox; Wasm ABI v2 adds file_stat / file_read_chunk",
        "GA Tasks: Postgres HA, CAS transitions, 60 s TTL reaper, cooperative cancel + Saga unwind",
        "Opt-in uploads: 64 MiB chunked bypass; FileBlobBackend for s3, gcs, azure, local, http"
